cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool in academic work, please cite the paper it implements."
title: simde-lint
abstract: >-
  Source-level detection of seven named mechanisms drawn from the six-type
  SIMDe emulation inefficiency taxonomy of the referenced paper, for C/C++
  codebases using x86 SIMD intrinsics translated to ARM NEON. It implements
  one mechanism per type (two for Type M), not the types in full.
type: software
authors:
